@	3600	IN	RP	mhale.sublevel-b2.stardust-archive.net. b2-114.stardust-archive.net.

; --- NODE-01-SUNSET-GOWER: Sunset Gower Studios // Sublevel B2-114 Vault, Los Angeles, CA ---
b2-114	3600	IN	TXT	"DISPATCH-1989-09-09-0140AM: Dr. Marcus Hale exited via Freight Elevator #4 with 36 BASF Chrome Maxima II 90 cassettes (109s ahead of security sweep). Do not let Orion call her a vocal synthesis patch."
