; --- REEL-SD-0037-EMPTY-BOOTH: Sublevel B2-114 Locked Isolation Booth // Neumann U87 (#3114) ---
sd0037	3600	IN	TXT	"REEL-SD-0037: 46m14s room-tone calibration recorded 1989-08-29 in an empty, cardkey-locked booth. At 31:14.2001 (+48dB gain): chair creaks, lyric sheet turns, D4-E4-F4-A4 hum, whisper: 'Marcus, you left the red light on.'"
sd0037	3600	IN	TXT	"LOG-URI: https://stardust-archive.net/forensics/room_tone_sd0037.txt // LRC-URI: https://stardust-archive.net/lyrics/reel-sd0037-room-tone.lrc"
